PMC-2789: FE[catalog]: Tags/Labels disable reason not shown on hover in the editor
Type: Bug
Parent: PMC-2663 — Tags & Labels
Labels: ai-run, service:catalog
Source: https://yourcompany.atlassian.net/browse/PMC-2789

Description:
Precondition:
While implementing PMC-2766 (locking {{Tags}}/{{Labels}} to read-only)

*Impact*: editors cannot tell why the field is locked.

Steps to reproduce:
# Open a product
# Hover {{Tags}}

Actual result:
Nothing is shown.

Expected result:
The disable reason is shown.

Acceptance criteria:
* Reason shown on hover
* No layout shift

